summary:
  The logo hunt keeps the first real picture it was answered with, not the
  best one.

history:
  Fetch missing logos used to do exactly that, and on Raadio Kadi's homepage
  it saved the 16x16 favicon.ico the page names ahead of its 1200x1200 logo;
  only a second press found the logo.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LogoHunt.qml

find:
                  Qt.callLater(function() { onDone(FaviconLogic.bestLogo(found)); });

replace:
                  Qt.callLater(function() { onDone(found.length ? found[0] : null); });

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_logohunt.qml::test_the_best_of_what_answered_is_kept_not_the_first.
  Line-neutral.
